# Provisioning-record keys, pinned per fleet (M8 plan C3): one line per key,
# `<fleet_id, 32 hex digits> <Ed25519 public key, 64 hex digits>`. Every
# provisioning record needs signatures by two distinct keys listed for the
# ledger's fleet. A fleet's genesis ceremony (C12) adds its lines; with none,
# tools/provision refuses every record. Record keys are used for nothing
# else, and none may be an NV delete key.
